  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B2B Bio Dairy Farm and Langerimgaard</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The core idea was transfer of technology from Langerimgaard to Bio Dairy Farm with focus on the three main areas of marketing and sales of dairy products, crop farming, and milk production. It also involved practical and theoretical transfer of knowhow from Langerimgaard&apos;s experience from Temangalo Farm to Bio Dairy farm. 

The employees of Bio Dairy Farm were to be trained in areas of field/crop management, beef and milk production management, and economic farming management.</narrative>
  </description>
